      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Riri ndiro neno ambaro Mwenyezi Mlungu wamuambira Jeremia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Unuka utserere hadi nyumbani kpwa mfinyangi wa miyo ya ulongo, kuko ndakupha ujumbe wangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Phahi nátserera, nchendamuona ye mfinyangi phakpwe muhamboni anaumba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyo mwiyo ariokala anaumba, kala ukabanangika mo mwakpwe mikononi. Naye ye mfinyangi achifinyanga mwiyo wanjina na ulongo uho kama arivyomendza mwenye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipho Mwenyezi Mlungu achiniambira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mwi atu a Iziraeli, dze, mino siweza kukuhendani vyo mfinyangi wa nyungu achivyohenda? Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba, ‘Lola, dza ulongo urivyo mikononi mwa mfinyangi, ndivyo murivyo mwimwi atu a Iziraeli mwangu mikononi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati wowosi nimendzapho naweza kungʼola, kuvundza na kuangamiza taifa ama ufalume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alafu taifa hiro richigaluka na kuricha uyiwe, phahi nindaricha kurihendera mai nrigopanga kurihendera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Vivyo hivyo wakati wowosi nchigomba kukala nindadzenga na kuimarisha taifa ama ufalume, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "chisha taifa hiro ririche kunitii na rihende mai, phahi nami ndaricha kurihendera manono nrigopanga kurihendera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha aambire atu a Juda na nyo asagalao Jerusalemu kukala Mwenyezi Mlungu anaamba hivi, “Lola, ninaapangira uyi. Chila mmwenga naariche njiraze mbii, agaluze mahendoge na masagazige.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ela aho andajibu aambe, “Higo ni bure! Swino hundaenderera na mipango yehu, chisha chila mutu andahenda kulengana na moyowe mui ndivyomlongoza.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 18:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chisha nyo atu achiamba, “Ndzoni humpangire njama Jeremia, mana go mafundzo ga shariya kula kpwa alavyadzi-sadaka tagandaangamika, wala ushauri wa atu a ikima, wala neno ra Mlungu kutsupira manabii. Ndzoni hugombe vii kumuhusu na husigatiye manani gosi agombago.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.18.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.18.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
